  "description": "CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120); One(ID LONG primary key) with one row. For each expression [Mid('abcd', 1073741823) ;; Mid('abcd', 1073741824) ;; Mid('abcd', 1073741823, 1) ;; Mid('abcd', 1073741824, 1) ;; Mid('abcd', 0) ;; Mid('abcd', 1, -1) ;; Right('abcd', 1073741824) ;; Right('abcd', -1) ;; LeftB('abcd', 2147483646) ;; LeftB('abcd', 1073741824) ;; MidB('abcd', 2147483647) ;; RightB('abcd', 2147483647) ;; InStr(1073741824, 'abcd', 'a') ;; InStr(2147483647, 'abcd', 'a') ;; Left('abcd', ID * 1073741824) & '' ;; Left('abcd', 1073741823 + ID)]: SELECT e FROM One as a snapshot, the value read. left-bounds found lengths above 1073741823 and negative lengths refused 5 at open, LeftB unbounded at 2147483647; asks the start bounds and the B forms' edges, and whether an operand from a field moves the failure to the read.",
